 445+ 5FAB              ErasePixelSprite16x16:
 446+ 5FAB C5               push bc
 447+ 5FAC D5               push de
 448+ 5FAD E5               push hl
 449+ 5FAE
 450+ 5FAE 60               ld   h, b
