 695+ 60C3 E6 03            and  3                 ; A = cell type (0..3)
 696+ 60C5
 697+ 60C5 D5               push de
 698+ 60C6 C5               push bc
 699+ 60C7
 700+ 60C7 ED 5B 24 7A      ld   de, (room_ptr)
