 336+ 75A6 3D               dec  a
 337+ 75A7 20 06            jr   nz, .not_wall
 338+ 75A9 21 B2 00         ld   hl, OFFSET_WALL
 339+ 75AC 19               add  hl, de
 340+ 75AD 18 04            jr   .draw_cell
 341+ 75AF              .not_wall:
